    title: "Windows 11 Insider Preview 發布新版本，涵蓋 Beta 與 Experimental 頻道建置資訊",
    summary: "本篇公告是 Windows Insider Program 團隊發布的更新資訊，宣布為 2026 年 10 月 2 日釋出新的 Windows 11 Insider Preview 建置。本次更新涵蓋多個測試頻道，包括 Beta 頻道（例如 Build 26220.9587）和 Experimental 頻道（例如 Build 26340.9596）。此外，文章也提供了針對 26H1 版本和未來平台（Future Platforms）的特定建置版本，例如 Beta 的 Build 28020.3142 和 Experimental 的 Build 28120.3151。這類建置主要用於早期測試和功能預覽，讓開發者和早期使用者能提前體驗未發布的 Windows 功能。公告同時提醒用戶，下週將有 Windows 和 Surface 的線上活動，讓用戶可以了解最新的產品動態與功能。",
    tags: ["Windows 11", "Insider Preview", "Beta", "Experimental", "Windows 26H1", "Windows 系統更新"],
    title_en: "Windows 11 Insider Preview Releases New Builds Covering Beta and Experimental Channels",
    summary_en: "This announcement from the Windows Insider Program team details the release of new Windows 11 Insider Preview builds scheduled for October 2, 2026. This update covers multiple testing channels, including the Beta channel (e.g., Build 26220.9587) and the Experimental channel (e.g., Build 26340.9596). Furthermore, the article provides specific build versions for the 26H1 release and Future Platforms, such as the Beta Build 28020.3142 and the Experimental Build 28120.3151. These builds are primarily intended for early testing and feature previews, allowing developers and early adopters to experience unreleased Windows functionality in advance. The announcement also reminds users of an upcoming online event next week for Windows and Surface, where they can learn about the latest product updates and features.",
