    id: "20261002-14650",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Windows",
    title: "Microsoft 推出 Excel Canvas，利用 Copilot 將試算表資料轉化為自動更新的報告",
    summary: "Microsoft 宣布將在十月推出 Excel Canvas 功能，這項功能旨在將傳統的試算表工作簿資料，自動轉化為包含視覺化圖表、關鍵指標和洞察的專業報告。使用者需要具備 Copilot 存取權限，並能透過自然語言提示（natural language prompts）來調整報告內容。該報告的優點是其底層資料變動時，報告內容會自動刷新。此舉是 Microsoft 近期持續強化 Excel 功能的體現，此前已新增了允許單元格包含多個數值等功能。然而，文章指出，使用者需謹慎評估 Copilot 選擇的指標和圖表是否合適，並留意此功能是否會與現有的儀表板工具產生市場競爭。Microsoft 此前曾多次調整 Copilot 相關功能，顯示其在整合應用方面仍處於快速迭代和調整的階段。",
    tags: ["Microsoft", "Excel", "Copilot", "Excel Canvas", "試算表", "數據分析"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Launches Excel Canvas, Using Copilot to Transform Spreadsheet Data into Automatically Updating Reports",
    summary_en: "Microsoft announced the launch of Excel Canvas in October. This feature aims to automatically transform traditional spreadsheet workbook data into professional reports containing visualized charts, key metrics, and insights. Users will require Copilot access and can adjust the report content using natural language prompts. The advantage of this report is that its content automatically refreshes when the underlying data changes. This move reflects Microsoft's ongoing effort to enhance Excel functionality, following previous additions such as the ability for a single cell to contain multiple values. However, the article notes that users must carefully evaluate whether the metrics and charts selected by Copilot are appropriate, and to be mindful of potential market competition with existing dashboard tools. Microsoft has previously adjusted Copilot-related features multiple times, indicating that its integration into applications is still in a phase of rapid iteration and adjustment.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft", "Excel", "Copilot", "Excel Canvas", "Spreadsheet", "Data Analysis"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/software/2026/10/02/excel-canvas-offers-to-turn-your-workbook-into-the-bosss-next-report/5300812", lang: "EN" }
    ]
