    title: "Apache Directory LDAP API 存在 CVE-2026-103880 漏洞，高 bcrypt 成本因子可能導致服務拒絕",
    summary: "Apache Directory LDAP API 存在一項名為 CVE-2026-103880 的資源消耗漏洞。此漏洞屬於非對稱資源消耗（Asymmetric Resource Consumption）類型。當 LDAP 伺服器支援 bcrypt 演算法，且儲存密碼時使用了過高的成本因子（例如 30）時，攻擊者可以利用此機制導致伺服器 CPU 長時間運算，最終造成服務拒絕（Denial of Service, DOS）。為避免此類伺服器資源耗盡，必須強制執行一個合理的成本限制。受影響版本為 Apache Directory LDAP API 2.1.0 至 2.1.8。建議使用者立即升級至 2.1.9 版本，以修補此漏洞。",
    tags: ["Apache Directory LDAP API", "CVE-2026-103880", "bcrypt", "Denial of Service", "LDAP"],
    title_en: "Apache Directory LDAP API has CVE-2026-103880 vulnerability; high bcrypt cost factor may cause Denial of Service",
    summary_en: "A resource consumption vulnerability, CVE-2026-103880, exists in the Apache Directory LDAP API. This vulnerability is classified as Asymmetric Resource Consumption. When an LDAP server supports the bcrypt algorithm and uses an excessively high cost factor (e.g., 30) for storing passwords, an attacker can exploit this mechanism to cause the server CPU to perform prolonged computations, ultimately leading to a Denial of Service (DoS). To prevent such server resource exhaustion, a reasonable cost limit must be enforced. Affected versions are Apache Directory LDAP API 2.1.0 through 2.1.8. Users are advised to immediately upgrade to version 2.1.9 to patch this vulnerability.",
    tags_en: ["Apache Directory LDAP API", "CVE-2026-103880", "bcrypt", "Denial of Service", "LDAP"],
