    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "Apache Directory LDAP API 存在堆疊溢位漏洞 (CVE-2026-103552)，客戶端可透過深層巢狀篩選器攻擊",
    summary: "Apache Directory LDAP API 存在一堆疊溢位（Stack Overflow）漏洞，編號為 CVE-2026-103552。此漏洞的攻擊向量為未綁定（unbound）的客戶端，透過發送一個深度巢狀的搜尋篩選器（search filter），導致伺服器在解碼過程中堆疊溢位。受影響的版本範圍為 Apache Directory LDAP API 1.2.0 到 1.2.8。為修復此問題，建議使用者立即升級至版本 1.2.9 或更高版本。此類漏洞屬於關鍵級別（critical），建議所有使用 LDAP API 的系統管理者應儘速進行修補。",
    tags: ["Apache Directory LDAP API", "CVE-2026-103552", "堆疊溢位", "LDAP", "Apache Software Foundation"],
    title_en: "Apache Directory LDAP API Stack Overflow Vulnerability (CVE-2026-103552) Exploitable via Deeply Nested Filters",
    summary_en: "The Apache Directory LDAP API contains a Stack Overflow vulnerability, designated as CVE-2026-103552. This vulnerability can be exploited by an unauthenticated client sending a deeply nested search filter, which causes a stack overflow during the server's decoding process. The affected versions range from Apache Directory LDAP API 1.2.0 to 1.2.8. To remediate this issue, users are advised to immediately upgrade to version 1.2.9 or higher. As this vulnerability is classified as critical, system administrators using the LDAP API are strongly recommended to apply patches promptly.",
