    id: "20261002-14551",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Apple",
    title: "Apple 確認 iPhone 18 Pro Max 在 AT&T 網路的通訊故障，受影響設備需硬體更換",
    summary: "Apple 確認了在 AT&T 網路上的部分 iPhone 18 Pro Max 用戶，可能會面臨失去通訊服務的問題，導致無法撥打電話。為此，Apple 已發布 iOS 27.0.1 軟體更新，並同步發布了電信商設定更新，旨在預防此問題發生。用戶應立即更新軟體，並留意自動下載的電信商設定更新。然而，Apple 強調，這些軟體更新無法恢復已經失去服務的設備。對於已經發生通訊故障的 iPhone 18 Pro Max 用戶，Apple 建議必須進行硬體更換，並應聯繫 Apple 或 AT&T 支援。值得注意的是，使用高通（Qualcomm）天線的 iPhone 18 Pro Max 受影響，而使用 Apple C2 天線的 iPhone 18 Pro 則不受此問題影響。",
    tags: ["Apple", "iPhone 18 Pro Max", "AT&T", "iOS 27.0.1", "通訊故障", "硬體更換"],
    title_en: "Apple Confirms Communication Failure on iPhone 18 Pro Max on AT&T Network; Affected Devices Require Hardware Replacement",
    summary_en: "Apple has confirmed that some iPhone 18 Pro Max users on the AT&T network may experience loss of communication service, resulting in the inability to make calls. To prevent this issue, Apple has released the iOS 27.0.1 software update and simultaneously published a carrier settings update. Users should update the software immediately and pay attention to the automatically downloaded carrier settings update. However, Apple emphasizes that these software updates cannot restore devices that have already lost service. For iPhone 18 Pro Max users who have experienced communication failure, Apple recommends hardware replacement and advises contacting Apple or AT&T support. Notably, the affected model is the iPhone 18 Pro Max using Qualcomm antennas, while the iPhone 18 Pro using Apple C2 antennas is unaffected by this issue.",
