    title: "Apple 傳推出 HomePad 智慧家庭中樞，搭載全新 homeOS 系統",
    summary: "Apple 據報導計劃於 10 月 13 日推出新的 Home 產品線，其中核心產品為搭載全新作業系統 homeOS 的「HomePad」智慧家庭中樞。根據 Mark Gurman 的報導，homeOS 的介面設計融合了 iPhone 的小工具（widgets）、iPad 的應用程式設計，以及 Apple Watch 的主畫面圖示。其預設使用者介面著重於照片幻燈片和時鐘顯示，類似於未來 iPhone Duo 的 StandBy Mode，用戶可透過向上滑動來開啟應用程式啟動器。\n\n在互動方面，Siri AI 是核心輸入方式，homeOS 的概念是讓 Siri AI 不僅是手機上的應用程式或介面，而是一個完整的作業系統，專注於個人搜尋和個人情境。雖然語音控制是主要互動方式，但系統仍支援觸控輸入，內建應用程式包括音樂、播客、照片、天氣、FaceTime、備忘錄、日曆、訊息和提醒等。值得注意的是，homeOS 不預期會有 App Store，但可以匯入來自 iPhone 的第三方小工具。整體而言，homeOS 的設計理念是讓用戶大部分時間的互動都透過 Siri 進行，類似於現有的 HomePod 體驗。",
    tags: ["Apple", "homeOS", "HomePad", "Siri AI", "智慧家庭", "iOS"],
    title_en: "Apple rumored to launch HomePad smart home hub, featuring new homeOS system",
    summary_en: "Apple is reportedly planning to launch a new Home product line on October 13th, with the core device being the \"HomePad\" smart home hub, which will run on the new homeOS operating system. According to Mark Gurman's report, the homeOS interface design blends iPhone widgets, iPad application design, and Apple Watch main screen icons. Its default user interface focuses on photo slideshows and clock displays, similar to the future iPhone Duo's StandBy Mode, and users can open the application launcher by swiping up.\n\nIn terms of interaction, Siri AI is the core input method. The concept behind homeOS is to make Siri AI not just an application or interface on a phone, but a complete operating system focused on personal search and personal context. Although voice control is the primary interaction method, the system still supports touch input. Built-in applications include Music, Podcasts, Photos, Weather, FaceTime, Notes, Calendar, Messages, and Reminders. Notably, homeOS is not expected to have an App Store, but it can import third-party widgets from iPhones. Overall, the design philosophy of homeOS is to allow users to interact primarily through Siri, similar to the existing HomePod experience.",
