    title: "iOS 27大幅升級鎖定畫面自訂功能：新增AI擴展、圖像生成與時鐘移動選項",
    summary: "iOS 27持續強化用戶對iPhone鎖定畫面的控制權，帶來多項重大自訂功能。在照片應用程式中，新增了「Extend」功能，利用AI智能擴展圖片內容，幫助用戶調整照片的長寬比，使其更適合作為壁紙。此「Extend」功能也延伸至鎖定畫面，能自動建議使用AI生成內容來修復不符合螢幕比例的壁紙。此外，用戶可以直接在設定或鎖定畫面選擇「Image Playground」選項，利用AI生成風格化的壁紙，或透過自然語言描述從零開始創建客製化壁紙。另一個實用改動是，用戶現在可以將鎖定畫面的時鐘移動到小工具（widget）的頂部，釋放更多壁紙空間。同時，用戶也可以選擇移除「Now Playing」小工具，避免誤觸時播放音樂。這些更新讓用戶能更自由地展示個人化的壁紙，提升了iOS 27的個人化體驗。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "Apple", "鎖定畫面", "AI", "Image Playground", "壁紙"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 Significantly Upgrades Lock Screen Customization: Adding AI Expansion, Image Generation, and Clock Movement Options",
    summary_en: "iOS 27 continues to strengthen user control over the iPhone lock screen by introducing several major customization features. In the Photos app, an 'Extend' feature has been added, which uses AI to intelligently expand image content, helping users adjust the aspect ratio of photos to make them more suitable for use as wallpapers. This 'Extend' feature also extends to the lock screen, automatically suggesting the use of AI-generated content to repair wallpapers that do not fit the screen ratio. Furthermore, users can now select the 'Image Playground' option directly in Settings or on the lock screen to generate stylized wallpapers using AI, or create custom wallpapers from scratch using natural language descriptions. Another practical change is that users can now move the lock screen clock to the top of the widget area, freeing up more wallpaper space. Additionally, users can choose to remove the 'Now Playing' widget to prevent accidental music playback. These updates allow users to display more personalized wallpapers, enhancing the overall personalization experience of iOS 27.",
