    trackers: ["os", "security"],
    category: "Android",
    title: "Android CLI 工具鏈升級：支援遠端設備串流與 AI 技能整合，強化開發流程",
    summary: "Google 宣布更新其 Android CLI 命令列工具，旨在簡化 Android 應用程式的開發流程。新功能包括透過 Android Device Streaming 支援遠端設備存取，讓開發者無需實體設備也能進行測試。開發者代理（agent）現在可以透過 Android CLI，在安全的 ADB over SSL 連線下，遠端連接實體設備，執行建置、部署、收集日誌和截圖等操作。此外，Google 也擴展了 Android skills 庫，提供結構化的指令（SKILL.md），幫助 AI 代理掌握平台特定的標準和最新 API。這些技能可讓代理執行更複雜的任務，例如審核 Play policy compliance，提升開發的精準度和效率。建議開發者利用這些更新的 CLI 工具和 skills 庫，將遠端測試能力納入開發環節。",
    tags: ["Android CLI", "Android Device Streaming", "AI agent", "Android skills", "Google", "開發工具鏈"],
    title_en: "Android CLI Toolchain Upgrade: Supports Remote Device Streaming and AI Skill Integration, Enhancing Development Workflow",
    summary_en: "Google has announced an update to its Android CLI command-line tools, designed to simplify the Android application development process. New features include support for remote device access via Android Device Streaming, allowing developers to test without physical devices. The developer agent can now remotely connect to physical devices via Android CLI, operating under a secure ADB over SSL connection to perform tasks such as building, deploying, collecting logs, and capturing screenshots. Furthermore, Google has expanded the Android skills library, providing structured instructions (SKILL.md) to help AI agents grasp platform-specific standards and the latest APIs. These skills enable agents to perform more complex tasks, such as auditing Play policy compliance, thereby increasing development precision and efficiency. Developers are advised to utilize these updated CLI tools and skills library to incorporate remote testing capabilities into their development cycle.",
    tags_en: ["Android CLI", "Android Device Streaming", "AI agent", "Android skills", "Google", "Development Toolchain"],
