    title: "Raspberry Pi 因記憶體成本上漲，調漲 Pi 4 與 Pi 5 價格",
    summary: "Raspberry Pi 宣布調漲 Pi 4 和 Pi 5 的價格，主要原因是記憶體（RAM）成本快速上漲。此前，2 GB Pi 4 的價格從約 $35 上漲至 $67.50，而同等規格的 Pi 5 也上漲至 $77.50。公司報告第一半年度營收和毛利均大幅增長，但同時指出庫存優勢已逐漸耗盡。Raspberry Pi 建議客戶考慮使用 Pi 3B、3A+ 或 3B+ 等較舊型號，並評估專案實際所需的記憶體容量。此價格上漲趨勢反映了市場記憶體供應緊張的背景，Micron CEO Sanjay Mehrotra 警告，RAM 供不應求的狀況可能持續到 2028 年甚至更久。",
    tags: ["Raspberry Pi", "Pi 4", "Pi 5", "RAM", "記憶體成本", "供應鏈"],
    title_en: "Raspberry Pi Increases Prices of Pi 4 and Pi 5 Due to Rising Memory Costs",
    summary_en: "Raspberry Pi announced price increases for the Pi 4 and Pi 5, primarily citing the rapid rise in memory (RAM) costs. Previously, the price of the 2 GB Pi 4 increased from approximately $35 to $67.50, and the similarly specified Pi 5 also rose to $77.50. While the company reported significant growth in both first-half revenue and gross profit, it also noted that its inventory advantage is gradually diminishing. Raspberry Pi advises customers to consider older models such as the Pi 3B, 3A+, or 3B+ and to reassess the actual memory capacity required for their projects. This price hike reflects the backdrop of tight market memory supply, with Micron CEO Sanjay Mehrotra warning that the shortage of RAM could persist until 2028 or even beyond.",
    tags_en: ["Raspberry Pi", "Pi 4", "Pi 5", "RAM", "Memory Costs", "Supply Chain"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/personal-tech/2026/10/02/once-a-35-computer-the-2-gb-raspberry-pi-4-now-costs-6750/5300774", lang: "EN" }
    ]
