    title: "中國關聯駭客組織 TA419 冒充 AI 專家竊取美國智庫與學術機構雲端帳號",
    summary: "安全公司 Proofpoint 揭露，一個代號 TA419 的駭客組織，正針對美國的 AI 政策專家、智庫、大學及法律機構進行大規模的情報竊取活動。攻擊目標似乎是收集關於美國 AI 政策、出口管制及戰略規劃的資訊，並與中國的情報需求相關。TA419 透過冒充 Anthropic 的高階員工，以「對 Claude 戰略應用意見徵詢」為誘餌，接觸目標。攻擊流程初期以業務郵件開場，隨後引導目標點擊包含多層跳轉的惡意連結，最終導向攻擊者控制的網站。攻擊技術結合了中間人 (AitM) 釣魚和改良的「無邊界 BitB」技術。攻擊者設計的自製模組能夠模擬正常的登入流程，甚至自動接受「保持登入狀態」並提交一次性驗證碼，目的是竊取可立即使用的雲端會話 Cookie，而非僅僅是密碼。雖然文章未公開確認帳號是否已被攻破，但此事件再次凸顯了 AI 專業知識成為國家級情報戰的主要目標。",
    tags: ["TA419", "Anthropic", "AI政策", "雲端帳號", "中間人攻擊", "Proofpoint", "情報戰"],
    title_en: "China-Linked Hacker Group TA419 Impersonates AI Experts to Steal Cloud Accounts from US Think Tanks and Academic Institutions",
    summary_en: "Security firm Proofpoint revealed that a hacker group, designated TA419, is conducting a large-scale intelligence theft campaign targeting US AI policy experts, think tanks, universities, and legal institutions. The attack appears aimed at gathering information related to US AI policy, export controls, and strategic planning, aligning with Chinese intelligence requirements. TA419 contacted targets by impersonating senior employees of Anthropic, using the pretext of soliciting 'strategic application feedback on Claude.' The attack process began with business emails, subsequently guiding targets to click malicious links involving multi-stage redirects, ultimately leading to attacker-controlled websites. The attack techniques combined Man-in-the-Middle (AiTM) phishing with an enhanced 'seamless BitB' technique. The custom module designed by the attackers was capable of simulating normal login procedures, even automatically accepting 'keep logged in' status and submitting one-time verification codes, with the goal of stealing immediately usable cloud session cookies rather than just passwords. Although the article did not confirm whether accounts were compromised, this incident once again highlights that AI expertise has become a primary target in national-level intelligence warfare.",
